╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ DeviceChain · dcctl bootstrap · instance acme · kind-devicechain · v1.11.0                       │
│ \x1b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\x1b[m │
│ \x1b[1;38;5;31mReview the instance\x1b[m                                                                              │
│                                                                                                  │
│ This is the instance the bootstrap will build, as the command line would resolve it. Nothing of  │
│ it has been created yet. Approve starts it; Back returns to the choices.                         │
│                                                                                                  │
│   \x1b[1mInstance\x1b[m      acme                                                                             │
│   \x1b[1mCluster\x1b[m       kind cluster devicechain (Standard footprint, Single), installed by the first    │
│                 stage                                                                            │
│   \x1b[1mProfile\x1b[m       default                                                                          │
│   \x1b[1mEscrow\x1b[m        /home/op/.devicechain/escrow/acme-rootkey.escrow; passphrase asked for when the  │
│                 run reaches its escrow step, twice, and never shown                              │
│                                                                                                  │
│ \x1b[1mEquivalent command (template)\x1b[m                                                                    │
│   dcctl bootstrap local acme --cluster=devicechain --escrow-passphrase-file=<file holding the    │
│   escrow passphrase> --yes                                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│ › \x1b[7m[ Back ]\x1b[m                                                                                       │
│   [ Approve and create the instance ]                                                            │
│   [ Exit ]                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│ \x1b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\x1b[m │
│ \x1b[2mTab next · Enter activate · Esc back\x1b[m                                                             │
